[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Poor Ian!]
[00:01.00]Lesson 91 | 第91课
[00:03.06]Poor Ian! | 可怜的伊恩！
[00:05.63]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.46]Who wanted to sell the house? | 谁想卖掉房子？
[00:16.36]Has Ian sold his house yet? | 伊恩把他的房子卖了吗？
[00:20.84]Yes, he has. | 是的，他卖了。
[00:23.16]He sold it last week. | 他上周卖的。
[00:26.28]Has he moved to his new house yet? | 他搬到新家了吗？
[00:30.65]No, not yet. | 不，还没有。
[00:33.27]He's still here. | 他还在这儿。
[00:35.61]He's going to move tomorrow. | 他明天就要搬家了。
[00:39.30]When? Tomorrow morning? | 什么时候？明天早上吗？
[00:43.54]No. Tomorrow afternoon. | 不，明天下午。
[00:47.37]I'll miss him. | 我会想念他的。
[00:49.47]He has always been a good neighbour. | 他一直是个好邻居。
[00:54.09]He's a very nice person. | 他是个很好的人。
[00:57.68]We'll all miss him. | 我们都会想念他的。
[01:01.50]When will the new people move into this house? | 新住户什么时候搬进这所房子？
[01:07.06]I think that they'll move in the day after tomorrow. | 我想他们会在后天搬进来。
[01:13.52]Will you see Ian today, Jenny? | 珍妮，你今天会见到伊恩吗？
[01:18.86]Yes, I will. | 是的，我会的。
[01:22.38]Please give him my regards. | 请代我向他问好。
[01:27.26]Poor Ian! He didn't want to leave this house. | 可怜的伊恩！他不想离开这所房子。
[01:33.88]No, he didn't want to leave, but his wife did! | 不，他不想走，但是他妻子想！